{"title": "Strange Gas", "pageid": 33117, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Strange_Gas", "categories": ["Clouds", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Strange_Gas_cloud.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Strange_Gas_cloud.png/300px-Strange_Gas_cloud.png.webp, /w/images/4/4e/Strange_Gas_cloud.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Strange Gas image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Strange_Gas_cloud.png/300px-Strange_Gas_cloud.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Strange_Gas_cloud.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Strange Gas</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Area\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">area</a>. It is a gas sublimate of <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a> pheromones. Exposure to this cloud requires passing a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> at the start of each turn within it, unless you are a githyanki.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>A strange gas of <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a> origin.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Cloud</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Otherworldly_Miasma\"> Condition: Otherworldly Miasma </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Otherworldly_Miasma_(Condition)\" title=\"Otherworldly Miasma (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Otherworldly_Miasma_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otherworldly_Miasma_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Otherworldly_Miasma_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Otherworldly_Miasma_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Otherworldly_Miasma_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Otherworldly_Miasma_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Otherworldly Miasma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Otherworldly_Miasma_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otherworldly_Miasma_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Otherworldly_Miasma_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Otherworldly_Miasma_(Condition)\" title=\"Otherworldly Miasma (Condition)\">Otherworldly Miasma</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;15)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;15)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Weakened by <a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Gas_(area)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strange Gas (area)\">alien fumes</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_Otherworldly_Miasma_.28Githyanki.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Otherworldly_Miasma_(Githyanki)\"> Condition: Otherworldly Miasma (Githyanki) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Otherworldly_Miasma_(Githyanki)_(Condition)\" title=\"Otherworldly Miasma (Githyanki) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Otherworldly_Miasma_Githyanki_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otherworldly_Miasma_Githyanki_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Otherworldly_Miasma_Githyanki_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Otherworldly_Miasma_Githyanki_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Otherworldly_Miasma_Githyanki_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Otherworldly_Miasma_Githyanki_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Otherworldly Miasma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Otherworldly_Miasma_Githyanki_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otherworldly_Miasma_Githyanki_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Otherworldly_Miasma_Githyanki_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Otherworldly_Miasma_(Githyanki)_(Condition)\" title=\"Otherworldly Miasma (Githyanki) (Condition)\">Otherworldly Miasma</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Gas_(area)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strange Gas (area)\">Alien fumes</a> have hardened this <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a>'s skin. It is <a href=\"/wiki/Resistant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistant\">resistant</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Strange gas is found in the Hatchery in Crèche Y'llek.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202542\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1291/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22398/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5737/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 688976/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.577      1 Template:Area_page\n100.00%   42.577      1 -total\n 46.96%   19.993      6 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 45.32%   19.297      2 Template:Condition\n 37.91%   16.140      1 Template:PageSeo\n 37.20%   15.840      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 34.25%   14.581      4 Template:Icon_text\n 29.25%   12.454     12 Template:Trim\n 23.92%   10.184      1 Template:Saving_throw\n 20.70%    8.814      4 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 